{"ts":1793393476151,"event":"done","summary":"PLAT-103 done. validateApp (libs/shared-contracts) now throws if app.owner is missing or blank; version bumped to 2.0.0 (breaking). Apps pass owner from package.json team: core-shell=platform (PR #3), sub-route-billing=payments (PR #2). Also fixed sub-route-reports (insights, PR #4), which calls validateApp and would have failed at startup; it was not in the ticket. PRs #1-#4 merged; CI and CD green on main for each. Assumptions: owner is hardcoded in each app's source to match package.json team (not read at build time); shared-contracts is inlined, so the 2.0.0 bump is informational and nothing is published; reports is not built or deployed by CD, so its change is merged but not deployed."}
